# Clarion Conqueror: "Activated abilities of artifacts, creatures, and planeswalkers can't be activated." A description
# that names a card type and no zone or the word "card" means a permanent of that type on the battlefield (CR 109.2), so an
# Elvish Spirit Guide still in Bot1's hand is not a creature and exiling it for {G} stays allowed with the Conqueror out,
# while the Llanowar Elves on the battlefield are stopped (the control). Compare the stopped permanents in the other
# Clarion Conqueror scenarios.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Clarion Conqueror
Llanowar Elves
Elvish Spirit Guide
Mox Emerald
Plains
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x13

